compact('Representation', 'Dense vector~A numerical representation supports learned similarity comparisons.|Token ID~An integer identifies a vocabulary item rather than its semantic meaning.|Similarity score~A comparison estimates closeness under a selected metric.|Document text~The original content remains necessary for grounded answers.', '0 Represent sentence meaning for semantic search? / 1 Identify a vocabulary entry during tokenization? / 2 Rank two compatible vectors by closeness? / 3 Supply readable evidence after retrieving a vector? / 0 Store one learned numerical representation per passage? / 2 Compare a query representation with a candidate? / 3 Preserve exact quoted wording independently of its embedding? / 1 Look up an entry in a tokenizer vocabulary? / 0 Encode similar paraphrases into nearby representations? / 2 Obtain a ranking value rather than the passage itself?'),
